{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab visible object. Check properties, do specific task, move to base. Scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToBase    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinRange    />",
